{"path":"experimental/make_array","title":"std::experimental::make_array","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>make_array","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/make_array","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Creates a std::array whose size is equal to the number of arguments and whose elements are initialized from the corresponding arguments.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/array&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> D <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span>, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>VT <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see below */</span>, sizeof...<span class=\"br0\">(</span>Types<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> make_array<span class=\"br0\">(</span> Types<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">t</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Creates a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\">std::array</a></span> whose size is equal to the number of arguments and whose elements are initialized from the corresponding arguments. Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>VT, sizeof...<span class=\"br0\">(</span>Types<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...</span></code>}.\n</p><p>If <code>D</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span></code>, then the deduced type <code>VT</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/common_type\"><span class=\"kw641\">std::<span class=\"me2\">common_type_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>. Otherwise, it is <code>D</code>.\n</p><p>If <code>D</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span></code> and any of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/decay\"><span class=\"kw634\">std::<span class=\"me2\">decay_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>...</span></code> is a specialization of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/reference_wrapper\">std::reference_wrapper</a></span>, the program is ill-formed.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><code>make_array</code> is removed in Library Fundamentals TS v3 because the <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array/deduction_guides\">deduction guide</a> for <code>std::array</code> and <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array/to_array\"><code>std::to_array</code></a> have been already in C++20.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><co